{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年52歲的劉愷威早前大方認愛現年32歲的黎紀君（Christy），二人打得火熱，近日更頻頻高調放閃！日前黎紀君在IG限時動態「洩蜜」，大曬多張與好友聚會的溫馨合照，除了劉愷威同黎紀君之外，江若琳同老公蕭唯展亦在場，眾人為徐加晴慶祝生日，亦為月底生日的黎紀君提早慶生，而劉愷威更全程緊貼女友，二人早已徹底融入彼此的朋友圈！</p><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君（Christy）在賀歲片《夜王》演出。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189186824770162688081645.jpeg/b3GobhISqtad7KzqMI6nbDyaHHvbtgWSG28AfBtvAHw\"/><figcaption>黎紀君（Christy）在賀歲片《夜王》演出。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎紀君由主持跨界踏入大銀幕出演《夜王》。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189198147318976512845320.jpeg/ds-eIDnbVJhQCGHHGJsHkIfaTRLwepdVzz0_3c89P90\"/><figcaption>黎紀君由主持跨界踏入大銀幕出演《夜王》。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人經常一起打波。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704147023532032581729.jpeg/T87pAAl8Zg0mtm5uDzgdLBrhRmlPz4cbzSscWM0rHFg\"/><figcaption>兩人經常一起打波。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人經常一起打波。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704134083842048263980.jpeg/VE6tyTyvEfH5uEGJniasa8ccPAnMBdsfZHi_JWR4vyU\"/><figcaption>兩人經常一起打波。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打得火熱。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189162740577603584724158.jpeg/EPoTParRkOwbK0wu_zzRO_-_yrtNBgCihZSm84WUpvM\"/><figcaption>打得火熱。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打得火熱。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189162737846980608368971.jpeg/5i0j-5Iv5CieIGzYhrV5ap0XK4ifEr9xppWIEaaViBE\"/><figcaption>打得火熱。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><p>劉愷威黎紀君甜蜜同框　大合照攬到實融入朋友圈</p><p>相中所見，現場準備了大閘蟹及生日蛋糕，劉愷威與黎紀君均戴上白色Cap帽，默契十足，站在後排的劉愷威從後環抱黎紀君，而黎紀君則依偎在男友懷中甜笑，相當甜蜜！除了溫馨切蛋糕及食大閘蟹之外，眾人更一起在客廳梳化打機消遣，當中劉愷威與黎紀君並肩坐在梳化上，一舉一動默契十足。</p><figure><img alt=\"融入朋友圈！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194702490994741248724805.jpeg/jdJJAMFGcMNtT65OllQutdWYkx_Xkkur1nWq0dZ1qtE\"/><figcaption>融入朋友圈！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"融入朋友圈！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194702488884875264406395.jpeg/mJs-eCNio_FbBTwSzrEBlz8i8a76uCT7pkF9g6ZBfYM\"/><figcaption>融入朋友圈！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"融入朋友圈！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194702486691123200076139.jpeg/xGAIJaD6oofXo_bebHV-IaoufCM5HtHHN2OMRjdjjEY\"/><figcaption>融入朋友圈！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"萬聖節。（IG@j_j.yellow）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193258788522561536902538.png/c2HYslrgNKkbjzCNaQWKC3I9X7U1uqEi4FH1JuBR9SY\"/><figcaption>萬聖節。（IG@j_j.yellow）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉愷威同女友黎紀君猶如「糖黏豆」般形影不離。（ig@j_j.yellow）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261031/1193258451673944064327149.png/XX3WKy6DcY9UNOBPw76nK3XDc8JjlUC5iRnS94kZ0vc\"/><figcaption>劉愷威同女友黎紀君猶如「糖黏豆」般形影不離。（ig@j_j.yellow）</figcaption></figure><p>劉愷威黎紀君跨越20歲年齡差　因匹克球（Pickleball）結緣志趣相投</p><p>劉愷威自2018年與楊冪離婚後，感情生活一直備受關注，他曾與內地女星李曉峰相戀，但今年4月宣告分手。直至近期劉愷威與模特兒出身、「第四代邦民女」黎紀君擦出愛火，雙方因同樣熱愛打匹克球（Pickleball）及網球而相識，志趣相投，雖然兩人年齡相差20歲，但相處融洽，感情穩定，近日更頻頻高調放閃，大曬幸福！</p><figure><img alt=\"志趣相投。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704149628325888642081.jpeg/P9S5-oJN2u3LrZABRYaRjMkY35dYRUqwyzCfwMswn8A\"/><figcaption>志趣相投。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"志趣相投。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704144490041344360871.jpeg/tEnafeiEm5Ex5EPad8KQ5yRVM_IwTOg8dl7jG3Ze4xs\"/><figcaption>志趣相投。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起打pickleball。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704141738446848935874.jpeg/5Yya6bvWHP3OfyCW7v-AbbGaPBUXsIlzNTGKeTUxink\"/><figcaption>一起打pickleball。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起打pickleball。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704142045024256357892.jpeg/eCYRg4yor9hyt3BCdiZrSd6ha4RGTedxTnBLJE5wSyQ\"/><figcaption>一起打pickleball。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起打pickleball。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704139373121536397058.jpeg/9LdL8SezRJD43X4JoIaAscexpn0ybycrHSMv7R0jL-0\"/><figcaption>一起打pickleball。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704136625721344069241.jpeg/iMnN9rS9QnoIEKckpgGN24A6TLvg5kC2Z_6xWWf-sVk\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704138751971328169825.jpeg/ACfzWetrffq6lHMqV4tVe9kBrcvH5CFFv4Fn5b-BZ-U\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（IG@christylaiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194704131856535552731849.jpeg/72lxUR1P3Xdrsb1DnOhrDO5OgqXfg-4uHCJjXhwiY14\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（IG@christylaiii）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.590622+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":997,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:15:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:49.169119+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:50.871280+00:00","content_hash":"a97bc6d92668cf464e3834fd11fd3c3d66f90a6c4bf3b8ce12654fe7e28bd134","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}